sequenceDiagram
    actor B as Buyer
    participant App as Desi Bazaar app
    participant S as Seller
    B->>App: Withdrawal notice (clearly labelled function)
    App->>App: return_requested [statutory_withdrawal]
    App->>B: Durable acknowledgement with receipt time
    App->>S: Deliver withdrawal notice + deadline
    App->>B: Standard return instructions
    Note over App,S: Statutory withdrawal needs NO seller authorisation
    B->>App: Ship + tracking → goods_sent_back
    App->>App: Buyer's return obligation ends (evidence)
    alt Buyer supplies return-shipping evidence
        B->>App: Upload tracking or drop-off receipt
        App->>App: refund_requested (14-day clock runs from notice)
        Note over App,S: Seller may withhold only until goods received or evidence seen
    else Seller confirms possession
        S->>App: Confirm possession → return_received
        App->>App: refund_requested
    end
    S->>B: Refund via direct Swish
    B->>App: Acknowledge → refund_acknowledged
